{"product_id":"the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-7","title":"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, Vol. 7","description":"\u003cp\u003ePerhaps it will remain vacant until the chosen one appears... As a teen, Konoha Satou wrote her Dark History―a self-indulgent fantasy romance fic featuring herself as the main character. But since she’s become its most detestable villainess, remembering every single little detail is the only way she can survive! After returning from the Village of the Afterlife, Sol has been acting very strange...Doesn’t he still hate Iana? What does it mean that he’s not his usual hostile self...?! Meanwhile, when Konoha and the rest visit Lalala Temple, an ambush raises the Konoha-becomes-a-saint flag―one that Satou must reverse at all costs if she wants her Dark History to have a happy ending!!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 201\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Akiharu Touka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781975362270\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434484424857,"sku":"Manga-A-39781975362270","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b240d885a5-The-Dark-History-of-the-Reincarnated-Villainess-Vol-7-_1.jpg?v=1753121616","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-7","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}